REPORT HEAD # BugReplay investigation

Status: bug_confirmed

Regression assertion failed in 2/2 clean runs and the unchanged test passed on the corrected control.

Complaint: Sometimes the cart becomes empty after I change the delivery address. Find the conditions that cause this.
Expected: Cart items and quantities must be preserved after saving a changed delivery address.

## Tested hypotheses
- Changing the delivery address to a new value and saving clears the cart
- Saving an address that was previously saved (saveSeq > 0) with a promo code applied clears the cart

## Recorded candidate
Observed: After saving a new delivery address ('300 Oak Avenue, Portland') with promo code FIELD10 applied, express delivery method selected, and this being the 3rd save (saveSeq went from 2 to 3), the cart was emptied. Cart had 2 items (canvas-pouch x1, desk-notebook x1) before the save and 0 items after.
1. goto /
2. click Add Canvas pouch
3. click Add Desk notebook
4. fill Delivery address: 100 Main Street, Seattle
5. click Save delivery address
6. select Delivery method: express
7. click Apply promo code
8. fill Delivery address: 200 Pine Street, Seattle
9. click Save delivery address
10. fill Promo code: FIELD10
11. click Apply promo code
12. fill Delivery address: 300 Oak Avenue, Portland
13. click Save delivery address

The candidate is confirmed only when the final status and independent evidence say so.

